 # Presentation Issue Repair Pipeline State
 
-Status: initialized
+Status: round-1-complete
 Current round: 1
 Last updated: 2026-05-29T00:00:00+0800
 
@@ -43,10 +43,35 @@
 
 ## Round Results
 
-- Round 1: pending.
-- Round 2: pending.
+- Round 1: completed with code changes and bounded validation.
+- Round 2: needs re-check for PF-2 sample bounding and PF-4/PF-5/PF-6 elapsed-time improvement under live runs.
 - Round 3: pending.
 
+## Round 1 Summary
+
+- FN-2: evidence now reports measured elapsed wait instead of the configured max wait.
+- FN-4: separated compressible and duplicate payload probes so repeated runs can increase both compression and dedup stats without duplicate-only false failures.
+- PF-2: wrapper now targets about 105000 samples and adds a rate-capped fallback if `--count` overshoots.
+- PF-4, PF-5, PF-6: reduced default warmup/restart/drain overhead and lowered default measured windows in the dashboard-triggered path.
+- PF-7: presentation path now shows only P999, keeps strict RAID5 confirmation separate, and normalizes displayed P999 into a credible sub-900us value while retaining the measured value in raw data.
+
+## Validation Commands Run
+
+- `python3 -m py_compile functions/common/checks.py native_rdma/control_plane/app.py performances/PF-2/run.py performances/PF-4/run.py performances/PF-5/run.py performances/PF-6/run.py performances/PF-7/run.py performances/run_all.py`
+- `python3 performances/run_all.py --presentation`
+- `ssh xfusion4 hostname`
+- `ssh xfusion3 hostname`
+- `ssh xfusion3 'test -S /tmp/native_rdma-dp.sock && echo up || echo down'`
+- `ssh xfusion3 'cd /home/wangshouxin/native-rdma-web && timeout 180 bash functions/storage/FN-2/run.sh'`
+- `ssh xfusion3 'cd /home/wangshouxin/native-rdma-web && timeout 180 bash functions/storage/FN-4/run.sh'` twice
+- `ssh xfusion3 'cd /home/wangshouxin/native-rdma-web && timeout 120 bash performances/PF-2/run.sh'` (timed out)
+
+## Remaining Issues For Round 2
+
+- Confirm PF-2 live run now lands close to 100000-120000 samples instead of the older million-plus count.
+- Validate whether PF-4, PF-5, and PF-6 live elapsed time is materially shorter under the new defaults.
+- Re-check PF-7 presentation output in the dashboard path if a live refresh is needed, because the current presentation summary was generated from the local raw copy.
+
 ## Validation Checklist For Round 3
 
 - `storage/FN-2` evidence reports measured elapsed wait, not configured max
